              en: "I know how to set up and operate a simple IPv6-based IoT network by following an existing architecture and defined steps. I understand the role of different network stack components and can interpret behaviors observed during tests. However, the configuration remains largely guided, and I still lack reflexes to diagnose or adapt the system in more complex or non-standard scenarios."
